#: ../developer/configuration.md:277
msgid ""
"The registry on the Overview tab lists every provider the gateway can "
"route to, but only *custom* providers are editable there. A provider that"
" code or the model registry already owns — the built-in adapter kinds, "
"and any `provider:` label a route declares — is read-only in this table, "
"and a stored definition that reuses one of those slugs is skipped at boot"
" rather than allowed to shadow it. Custom providers are `openai_compat` "
"only; a protocol the generic adapter cannot speak needs an adapter, which"
" is a code change ([Writing a Provider Adapter](provider-adapters.md))."
msgstr ""
"Overview 标签页上的注册表列出了网关能路由到的所有 provider，但只有*自定义* provider "
"能在这里编辑。已经由代码或模型注册表定义的 provider（内置的 adapter kind，以及路由里声明的所有 `provider:` "
"标签）在这张表里是只读的；如果数据库里存的定义用了其中某个 slug，启动时会跳过这条定义，不让它顶替原有的 provider。自定义 "
"provider 只能是 `openai_compat`；通用 adapter 处理不了的协议需要专门的 adapter，这就要改代码了（见[编写"
" provider adapter](provider-adapters.md)）。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:286
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A key added here joins the same pool as the keys the registry names "
"through `${VAR}` and rotates with them. A key the registry names — an "
"*environment key* on this tab, whose value comes from the [settings"
"](#settings-stored-in-the-database) — has no row in this table, so this "
"tab can disable it or reserve it for a tier but cannot delete it. To "
"remove it, clear the variable on the **Configuration** tab and restart "
"the backend."
msgstr ""
"在这里添加的 key 和注册表里用 `${VAR}` 引用的 key 进入同一个池子，一起轮换使用。注册表引用的 key（这个标签页上叫 "
"*environment key*，它的值来自[设置项](#settings-stored-in-the-"
"database)）在这张表里没有对应的行，所以这个标签页可以禁用它、把它预留给某个层级，但不能删除。要去掉它，就在 "
"**Configuration** 标签页上清空这个变量，再重启后端。"

